{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is in sight, approach it; pick it up; check properties; do task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
